<view class="container">
  <block wx:if="{{uiState === 'loading'}}">
    <view class="tw-state">加载中…</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:elif="{{uiState === 'error'}}">
    <view class="tw-state">
      <view>监测点加载失败</view>
      <view class="tw-muted err-msg">{{errorMsg}}</view>
      <button class="tw-btn-primary retry-btn" bindtap="load">重试</button>
    </view>
  </block>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="tw-card">
      <view class="tw-card-title">{{reach.name}}</view>
      <view class="row"><text class="tw-muted">监测点 ID</text><text>{{reach.reachId}}</text></view>
      <view class="row"><text class="tw-muted">拓扑角色</text><text>{{roleText}}</text></view>
      <view class="row">
        <text class="tw-muted">在线状态</text>
        <text class="tw-badge {{badgeClass}}">{{statusText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="row"><text class="tw-muted">最后有效观测</text><text>{{lastText}}</text></view>
      <view class="row"><text class="tw-muted">坐标状态</text><text>{{reach.coordinateStatus === 'VERIFIED' ? '已核实' : '逻辑点（示意拓扑）'}}</text></view>
      <view class="row" wx:if="{{reach.officialCandidateName}}">
        <text class="tw-muted">官方候选断面</text><text>{{reach.officialCandidateName}}（待核实）</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="tw-card">
      <view class="tw-card-title">最新指标</view>
      <view class="tw-state placeholder">实时指标与历史趋势将在 M1 观测接口就绪后展示</view>
    </view>

    <view class="tw-muted hint">
      该点连续观测数据来自 MQTT 模拟链路并明确标注；官方月报仅提供月度水质类别背景，不展示为连续曲线。
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
